    </node>
    <node id="&quot;1864&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"In 1864, a gristmill was built at the site of what would later become Lake Mills, marking an early development in the area."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0418-24c51ee113b4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;1869&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"In 1869, Lake Mills was platted, indicating the formal establishment of the city."&gt;</data>
